  "instructions": [
    "preheat oven to 375°f (190°c).",
    "cut tomatoes in half and place in a baking dish, cut-side up.",
    "sprinkle cumin and coriander over the tomatoes.",
    "in a separate bowl, mix together ricotta cheese, mozzarella, eggs, and a pinch of salt.",
    "spread a layer of the cheese mixture over the tomatoes, followed by a layer of lamination puff.",
    "repeat the layers until all ingredients are used, finishing with a layer of cheese on top.",
    "cover with foil and bake for 30 minutes, then remove foil and bake for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "let the lasagna rest for 10-15 minutes before slicing and serving."
  ],
